 retro-consoles<br>- Steam page header image art by Jo\u00ebl Jurion!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345340/extras/49b00c1237053b1e35f2afbc09aad236.poster.avif?t=1760021282\" width=284 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345340/extras/49b00c1237053b1e35f2afbc09aad236.webm?t=1760021282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345340/extras/49b00c1237053b1e35f2afbc09aad236.mp4?t=1760021282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b9f872c4287faf43323a1dfd15a29b33955f1cf6.jpg","localized_name":"This year on vacation\u2026 on a desert island?!","name":"This year on vacation\u2026 on a desert island?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345340/b9f872c4287faf43323a1dfd15a29b33955f1cf6.jpg"},{"icon":"5524b6da9a745e4bcf62dfaa33bad04e06ad85f2.jpg","localized_name":"Milk is sooo good!","name":"Milk is sooo good!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345340/5524b6da9a745e4bcf62dfaa33bad04e06ad85f2.jpg"},{"icon":"f8f2a8cd6faa7907947f4ed802fe510e8c1ad89a.jpg","localized_name":"Beach volley champion!","name":"Beach volley champion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345340/f8f2a8cd6faa7907947f4ed802fe510e8c1ad89a.jpg"},{"icon":"bd0ff0d0a05b87b228dc7484c3f796a6bd1adcf1.jpg","localized_name":"Like the good old days\u2026","name":"Like the good old days\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345340/bd0ff0d0a05b87b228dc7484c3f796a6bd1adcf1.jpg"},{"icon":"3ae483baa35faeec9965b1ba364abae5b2e0c4a8.jpg","localized_name":"Applause-O-Meter score is 100!","name":"Applause-O-Meter score is 100!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.ste